  ('Gimbutas, Marija. "Veles-Volos." In Encyclopedia of Religion. Encyclopedia.com. Accessed October 6, 2026. https://www.encyclopedia.com/environment/encyclopedias-almanacs-transcripts-and-maps/veles-volos.', 'Gimbutas, Marija. Encyclopedia of Religion, 2nd ed., under "Veles-Volos." Edited by Lindsay Jones. Detroit: Macmillan Reference USA, 2005. Encyclopedia.com. Accessed October 6, 2026. https://www.encyclopedia.com/environment/encyclopedias-almanacs-transcripts-and-maps/veles-volos. (Print details from the Library of Congress catalogue record, LCCN 2004017052.)'),
